            <div xml:id="d357-a1">

                <pb facs="1129" n="979" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg979"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Receipt of the chief direction of the Russian Red
                        Gross Society.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 83890.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#right">Rubles 1,940.</p>
                <p>On May 21 (June 3), 1907, was received by the treasury of this administration and
                    credited under article No. 4199, from the American Red Cross Society for the
                    relief of famine sufferers, the sum of 1,940 rubles.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Tonko</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >Treasurer.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">I. Koshennikoff</hi>, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Comptroller.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
